okay, blog is an executible that is used to interface with my blog. when you run it it asks you to select what to open the blog with.  the options are 

1 Last Used 
2 gemini CLI
3 cursor
4 obsidian

the user can press a corresponding number- or jsut hit enter (to select last used) or can use the arrow keys to select an option or press the corresponding letter- so like g = gemini, c = cursor, o = obsiidial, l = last used

we will store information about the commands used in this project in a file ~/.alter-ego/blog.tmal

